--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived factual data (no files copied)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

assets/device/<family>/chips.json, assets/ioc/, assets/templates/ and
lib/data/ are generated fact tables extracted from the locally installed
STM32CubeMX device database (position, pin names, alternate functions,
package, clock limits) and from the public STM32 reference manuals. They
contain facts, not copied source files; regeneration instructions live in
scripts/build-assets.mjs.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Interoperating software (not redistributed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The plugin drives the following programs through their own command-line
interfaces and libraries. They are not part of this package and keep their
own licenses:

- STM32CubeMX and STM32Cube firmware packages (ST license terms)
- GNU Arm Embedded Toolchain: arm-none-eabi-gcc, gdb, binutils (GPL-3.0)
- OpenOCD (GPL-2.0-or-later)
- CMake (BSD-3-Clause), Ninja (Apache-2.0), MSYS2 (various)
- Python (PSF-2.0), poppler / pdftotext (GPL-2.0)

